const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"为什么把股票与债券放在一起？",en:"Why bring stocks and bonds together?"},body:{zh:"这篇论文问的不是哪只股票会涨，而是不同资产的收益能否由少数共同变化解释。作者把股票、政府债券和公司债券放进同一框架：如果市场相互联系，解释股票的变量与解释债券的变量可能有交集。",en:"The question is whether a small set of shared movements helps explain returns across assets, not which security will rise. Fama and French study stocks alongside government and corporate bonds, asking whether connected markets also share sources of return variation."}},{title:{zh:"债券因子是收益差，不是收益率差",en:"Bond factors are return differences, not yield spreads"},body:{zh:"论文的TERM用长期国债月收益减去上月末已知的一月期国库券利率；DEF用长期公司债组合收益减去长期国债收益。这两个定义都依赖持有期回报，不能直接用两条到期收益率相减替代。债券价格、期限与回报口径需要先核对。",en:"TERM subtracts the previously observed one-month bill rate from the monthly long-government-bond return. DEF subtracts the long-government-bond return from the long-corporate-bond portfolio return. These are holding-period return constructions, not interchangeable with differences between quoted yields. Price, tenor and return conventions matter."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/Fama-French_JFE93.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第2.1.1节：债券市场因子",en:"Original §2.1.1: bond-market factors"}}},{title:{zh:"从公司特征到共同因子",en:"From characteristics to common factors"},body:{zh:"作者用月度时间序列回归，把资产超额收益与市场、规模、账面市值比，以及期限和违约相关的组合收益联系起来。公司规模是一个特征；对规模组合收益的敏感度是回归系数。阅读时应把两者分开。",en:"Time-series regressions relate monthly excess returns to the market, size, book-to-market, term and default-related portfolio returns. A firm's size is a characteristic; its loading on a size-related return series is a regression coefficient. Keeping those concepts separate is central to reading the paper."}},{title:{zh:"解释共同波动，不等于解释全部收益",en:"Two different tests of explanation"},body:{zh:"论文同时关注共同波动与平均收益：前者看因子能解释多少随时间的变化，后者看超额收益回归的截距是否仍明显偏离零。作者报告股票的三个因子与债券的两个因子具有解释力，但这不表示任何资产、任何时期都没有剩余差异。",en:"Shared variation and average returns are different tests. Loadings and fit describe co-movement; intercepts assess unexplained average excess returns. The authors report explanatory roles for three stock-market and two bond-market factors, without establishing universal coverage of every asset or period."}},{title:{zh:"分组断点来自哪个市场？",en:"Which market supplies the sorting breakpoints?"},body:{zh:"规模分组以纽约证交所股票的市值中位数为断点，再应用于包含Amex与Nasdaq的样本；账面市值比分组也采用纽约证交所的30%和70%断点。因此小股票组不等于全样本数量的一半，也不代表市值的一半。更换断点市场会改变组合，不能把同名排序当成完全相同的研究设计。",en:"The NYSE median capitalization splits size groups across the wider NYSE, Amex and Nasdaq sample; NYSE 30th and 70th percentiles also determine book-to-market groups. The small group is therefore neither half of all stocks nor half of aggregate capitalization. Changing the breakpoint universe changes the portfolios even when the sorting labels remain identical."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/Fama-French_JFE93.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第2.1.2节：六个组合的分组断点",en:"Original §2.1.2: breakpoints for six portfolios"}}},{title:{zh:"带着什么问题继续读？",en:"A useful reading question"},body:{zh:"先读因子组合如何构造，再看回归截距，不要只看拟合优度。准备对应数据时，记录市场范围、无风险利率、财务信息可得日期和组合重建规则。1993年文中的五个跨资产因子，也不是后来加入盈利与投资的股票五因子模型。",en:"Read portfolio construction before interpreting intercepts or fit. For data preparation, record the market universe, risk-free benchmark, accounting availability and reconstitution rules. The five cross-asset factors here are not the later equity five-factor model that adds profitability and investment."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"历史美国样本中的解释力，不证明当前市场溢价或可交易收益；样本、交易成本和制度背景需要另行评估。",en:"Historical US explanatory power does not establish a current premium or executable return; sample construction, costs and institutions require separate assessment."}};export{e as default};
